{"id":"7cc892ce95ac7a4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-prop-iterated-forcing.md","title":"Finite Support Iteration","display":"prop-iterated-forcing — Finite Support Iteration","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-iterated-forcing","aliases":["58-prop-iterated-forcing"],"display":"prop-iterated-forcing — Finite Support Iteration","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-iterated-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-iterated-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-iterated-forcing — Finite Support Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15b258e6284e3da4\" href=\"?note=15b258e6284e3da4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}\\in V\">\\(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}\\in V\\)</span> (set ground model, ordinal length, stage forcings, and iterand names)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)=\\langle P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta\\rangle\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)=\\langle P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}(\\beta)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\rangle\">\\(\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}(\\beta)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S\\)</span> (canonical finite-support-iteration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15b258e6284e3da4\" href=\"?note=15b258e6284e3da4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> (two-argument countable-chain-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> is the membership-language formula obtained by expanding the defining equivalence for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span> is its fixed set code under <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> (six-argument forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta,\n\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)=\\langle P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}(\\beta)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,1_\\beta,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta\\rangle,P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\gamma)=\\langle P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta,\n\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)=\\langle P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta,1_\\beta\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}}(\\beta)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta,\\dot1_\\beta\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,1_\\beta,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\dot Q_\\beta,\\dot\\leq_\\beta\\rangle,P_\\beta,\\leq_\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\gamma)=\\langle P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite-support iterations of iterands forced to satisfy c.c.c. preserve c.c.c.; the c.c.c. formula code is fixed by quotation rather than left as a free meta-level parameter.</li>\n<li>Suitable finite-support c.c.c. iterations can force Martin's Axiom together with a chosen value of the continuum; they do not in general preserve or imply CH.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"15b258e6284e3da4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"ta